    {
      "id": 163397,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-22T19:10:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"logan_mann\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/43a26b/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> logan_mann:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have all of the currently available Tactics sets. I did not get in on the Broken City Kickstarter. What characters are announced at this point for tactics development?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The Dark Watch Team(With Pinion aka Matriarch taking the missing/dead Nightmist's place)</p>\n<p>Exemplar (aka Chairman Pike)</p>\n<p>Plauge Rat</p>\n<p>Catastrophe &amp; Verge (new characters. Played as a pair)</p>\n<p>Renegade (aka ChronoRanger)</p>\n<p>Man-Grove</p>\n<p>\"The Spites\" (5 characters that embody the very essence of the perfect forms of the 5 original drugs that made up Spite)</p>\n<p>Becky Blast (a former FILTER agent)</p>\n<p>Glamour (same mask but likely a different person than the Glamour from the Slaughterhouse 6 in SotM)</p>\n<p>Hippocolypse (aka The Hippo)</p>\n<p>Heartbreaker</p>\n<p>New Promo Alt Panels for The Operative and Ambuscade</p>",
