      "created_at": "2016-02-22T23:56:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, I think I'd heard about all those. I was confused in another thread talking about promos and someone wanted a naturalist promo but someone else said the last promo already looks like he'd gotten to what he looks like in Tactics and I got confused. So the Naturalist is not yet announced for Tactics. Maybe they were referring to card art I hadn't noticed.</p><p>That said, he would be AWESOME in Tactics. I want minis of him and all his forms.</p>",
